OL,3,GNEWSABuilding starts on new railway
OL,4,Astation
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on a new town's
OL,7,Frailway station where up to 11,000
OL,8,Fhomes are being built.
OL,10,FThe station, at Waterbeach near
OL,11,FCambridge, is about 1.5 miles (2.4km)
OL,12,Faway from the existing one, and it is
OL,13,Fdue to open in 2028.
OL,15,FThe Greater Cambridge Partnership
OL,16,F(GCP), a transport delivery body, and
OL,17,FHomes England are funding the project.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
